# Issue #787: the reporter-position alias path over a user procedure that never reaches `return`.
# `define forward` takes a built-in name, so `ol-reserved-word` is reported and the program never
# runs: the event stream is empty. Since issue #815 the check sees the whole program, so the
# `print fd` on the last line is judged too and reports its own faults beside the declaration's.
# Re-legalise `define forward` and this fixture reddens, leading the next reader to #787.
define forward
  print 1
end
print fd